		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales US]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=115158</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="641" height="793" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Kohl&#039;s US LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 November List" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List.jpg 641w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List-242x300.jpg 242w" sizes="(max-width: 641px) 100vw, 641px" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>Kohl&#8217;s US LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 are now officially live! You can save up to 40% off</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-kohls-lego-black-friday-deals-2026-now-live-up-to-40-off-over-220-sets-to-choose-from/">[US] Kohl&#8217;s LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 Now Live: Up to 40% off (Over 220 Sets to Choose From)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://howl.link/n1ilw3d1k8l86" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115162 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List.jpg" alt="" width="641" height="793" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List.jpg 641w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-List-242x300.jpg 242w" sizes="(max-width: 641px) 100vw, 641px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/nig6x6lzl0x3u" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kohl&#8217;s US</a> LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 are now officially live! You can save <span style="text-decoration: underline;">up to</span> 40% off on selected LEGO building sets. There are <a href="https://howl.link/n1ilw3d1k8l86" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over 220 LEGO sets to choose from</a>.</p>
<p>You can also earn $15 Kohl&#8217;s Cash for every $50 Spent. This promotion is valid from November 22-30, 2026 only. Free shipping with a minimum $25 USD purchase.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="wp-image-115161 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-with-Kohls-Cash.jpg" alt="" width="1029" height="412" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-with-Kohls-Cash.jpg 1782w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-with-Kohls-Cash-300x120.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-with-Kohls-Cash-1024x410.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-with-Kohls-Cash-768x308.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Kohls-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-November-with-Kohls-Cash-1536x615.jpg 1536w" sizes="(max-width: 1029px) 100vw, 1029px" /></p>
<p>My favorite deal would probably be the <a href="https://howl.link/w5pc2w61o4g0k" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Icons Golden Retriever Puppy 11384</a> for<strong> $83.99</strong> (reg.$139.99). Savings work out to be 40% off.</p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/w5pc2w61o4g0k" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-104217 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Icons-11384-Golden-Retriever-Puppy-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="855" height="856" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Icons-11384-Golden-Retriever-Puppy-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 855w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Icons-11384-Golden-Retriever-Puppy-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Icons-11384-Golden-Retriever-Puppy-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Icons-11384-Golden-Retriever-Puppy-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x769.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 855px) 100vw, 855px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/w5pc2w61o4g0k" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-104218 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Icons-11384-Golden-Retriever-Puppy-February-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="563" height="881" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Icons-11384-Golden-Retriever-Puppy-February-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 563w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Icons-11384-Golden-Retriever-Puppy-February-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-192x300.jpg 192w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 563px) 100vw, 563px" /></a></p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<p>We also have a<strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Sales Page Hub</a></strong> too. The <strong>page is updated regularly</strong> so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any bargains. For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="608" height="486" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 608px) 100vw, 608px" /></p>
