<li><strong>Buy LEGO at eBay (Secondary Marketplace):</strong> <a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay USA</a> | <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay Canada</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-104364 size-full" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Lord-of-the-Rings-LOTR-11373-Saurons-Helmet-March-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-5.jpg" alt="" width="1116" height="736" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Lord-of-the-Rings-LOTR-11373-Saurons-Helmet-March-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-5.jpg 1116w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Lord-of-the-Rings-LOTR-11373-Saurons-Helmet-March-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-5-300x198.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Lord-of-the-Rings-LOTR-11373-Saurons-Helmet-March-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-5-1024x675.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Lord-of-the-Rings-LOTR-11373-Saurons-Helmet-March-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-5-768x506.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1116px) 100vw, 1116px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">For a character that sent ripples of fear across Middle Earth, it would be surprising if one of his accessories didn’t attain iconic status. Sauron’s Helmet is a notable part of the Lord of the Rings series, and you can get a miniscale version from LEGO. The set has 538 pieces, but do not mistake it for a small piece. It has a height of 13 inches and a width of 5 inches.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">As for the features, we don’t get much here, save for the fact that it is a detailed replica of the one in the movies. The set also comes with a minifigure of Sauron, which is one way to make up for the lack of mechanical features. For a helmet, I’d say that is okay.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You’ll find a stand and a plaque to properly display this piece. Line it up with the rest, and you’ll see why it is easily one of the 7 best LEGO Icons under $100.</span></p>
<h3><span style="font-weight: 400;">6. Williams Racing FW14B &amp; Nigel Mansell</span></h3>
<p><b>Set number:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 10353</span></p>
<p><b>Price:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> $55.99 (sales price as of this writing; original price is $79.99)</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Official LEGO Site:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Amazon:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at eBay (Secondary Marketplace):</strong> <a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay USA</a> | <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay Canada</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-92524 size-full" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date.jpg" alt="" width="890" height="447" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date.jpg 890w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-300x151.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/18-LEGO-Icons-10353-Williams-Racing-FW14B-Nigel-Mansell-March-2025-Release-Date-768x386.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 890px) 100vw, 890px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">And here again, we find ourselves going back to vehicles. This one is special, like the rest, but goes even further. The star figure here is Nigel Mansell, the only person to hold the</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">The American CART IndyCar World Series Title (1993)</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Formula One World Drivers’ Championship (1992)</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Mansell built a name with his aggressive driving style, but some might recognize him quicker from the iconic mustache. His minifigure alone makes this set one of the 7 best LEGO Icons under $100.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You’ll get a set with 799 pieces. It comes with the printed Goodyear lettering on the tyres, which look slick, by the way. The steering is working, and the engine is detailed.</span></p>
<h3><span style="font-weight: 400;">7. How to Train Your Dragon: Toothless</span></h3>
<p><b>Set number:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 10375</span></p>
<p><b>Price:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> $69.99</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Official LEGO Site:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at Amazon:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></li>
<li><strong>Buy LEGO at eBay (Secondary Marketplace):</strong> <a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay USA</a> | <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay Canada</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-97305 size-full" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/18-LEGO-Icons-10375-How-to-Train-Your-Dragon-Toothless-Summer-July-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle.jpg" alt="" width="1179" height="775" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/18-LEGO-Icons-10375-How-to-Train-Your-Dragon-Toothless-Summer-July-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle.jpg 1179w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/18-LEGO-Icons-10375-How-to-Train-Your-Dragon-Toothless-Summer-July-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-300x197.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/18-LEGO-Icons-10375-How-to-Train-Your-Dragon-Toothless-Summer-July-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-1024x673.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/18-LEGO-Icons-10375-How-to-Train-Your-Dragon-Toothless-Summer-July-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-768x505.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1179px) 100vw, 1179px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Rounding off the list for today is Toothless from How to Train Your Dragon. It has 784 pieces, but what I love even more is the posable head and the plasma-blast accessory. Position the latter in the mouth, and you’ll have a more realistic display of this iconic dragon.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The How to Train Your Dragon: Toothless set makes for an impressive fantasy display model. Besides the plasma-blast attachment, you can go with the fish option. Both look good on the iconic Night Fury.</span></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">7 Best LEGO Icons Under $100</span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Besides keeping an eye out for the prices of these sets, you also have to consider their retirement. LEGO retires sets regularly, but it does make up for it by releasing new ones. Ensure you follow Toysnbricks to get the latest information on the newest releases.</span></p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="815" height="651" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 815px) 100vw, 815px" /></p>
