					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="877" height="850" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/18-LEGO-Super-Mario-Kart-72037-Mario-Standard-Kart-May-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="18+ LEGO Super Mario Kart 72037 - Mario &amp; Standard Kart May 2025 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/18-LEGO-Super-Mario-Kart-72037-Mario-Standard-Kart-May-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 877w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/18-LEGO-Super-Mario-Kart-72037-Mario-Standard-Kart-May-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x291.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/18-LEGO-Super-Mario-Kart-72037-Mario-Standard-Kart-May-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x744.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 877px) 100vw, 877px" /></p>
<p>Amazon US now has the 18+ LEGO Super Mario: Mario Kart &#8211; Mario &#38; Standard Kart 72037 for</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/us-amazon-lego-mario-standard-kart-20-off-and-lego-black-friday-week-2026-deals-continue/">[US] Amazon LEGO Mario &#038; Standard Kart (20% off) and LEGO Black Friday Week 2026 Deals Continue</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> now has the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Super-Mario-Standard-Birthday/dp/B0DRW6K649?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=608cd6ab95694e46ccbeaa4c28f02339&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Super Mario: Mario Kart &#8211; Mario &amp; Standard Kart 72037</a> for <strong>$135.99</strong> (reg.$169.99). Savings work out to be 20% off.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-94821 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/18-LEGO-Super-Mario-Kart-72037-Mario-Standard-Kart-May-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="877" height="850" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/18-LEGO-Super-Mario-Kart-72037-Mario-Standard-Kart-May-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 877w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/18-LEGO-Super-Mario-Kart-72037-Mario-Standard-Kart-May-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x291.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/18-LEGO-Super-Mario-Kart-72037-Mario-Standard-Kart-May-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x744.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 877px) 100vw, 877px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-94822 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/18-LEGO-Super-Mario-Kart-72037-Mario-Standard-Kart-May-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="799" height="632" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/18-LEGO-Super-Mario-Kart-72037-Mario-Standard-Kart-May-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 1100w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/18-LEGO-Super-Mario-Kart-72037-Mario-Standard-Kart-May-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x237.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/18-LEGO-Super-Mario-Kart-72037-Mario-Standard-Kart-May-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x810.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/18-LEGO-Super-Mario-Kart-72037-Mario-Standard-Kart-May-2025-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x607.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 799px) 100vw, 799px" /></p>
<p>The <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-Jurassic-World-77982/dp/B0G2T2MX9L?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=4721f957b77063f811cc187d27589c04&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Jurassic World Spinosaurus Dinosaur Escape 77982</a> is also on sale for <strong>$59.95</strong> (reg.$74.99). Savings also too work out to be 20% off.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-106522 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="804" height="645" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x241.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x822.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x616.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 804px) 100vw, 804px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-106524 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="781" height="626" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x240.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x820.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x615.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 781px) 100vw, 781px" /></p>
<p>In addition, as mentioned in our earlier article, <a href="https://www.amazon.com/blackfriday?bubble-id=deal-collection-alldeals&amp;discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522departments%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522165795011%255C%2522%255D%252C%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=e7f219edc6df22ec85ffa22440fa2e57&amp;language=en_US&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Black Friday Week 2026</a> is already here at Amazon. There are <a href="https://www.amazon.com/blackfriday?bubble-id=deal-collection-alldeals&amp;discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522departments%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522165795011%255C%2522%255D%252C%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=e7f219edc6df22ec85ffa22440fa2e57&amp;language=en_US&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over 20 LEGO items discounted</a>. Do note that there <a href="https://www.amazon.com/blackfriday?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=81f47f3d5c08100b4f5fd434980266c8&amp;language=en_US&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">also Black Friday deals in every other department (not just LEGO)</a>.</p>
<p>Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/blackfriday?bubble-id=deal-collection-alldeals&amp;discounts-widget=%2522%257B%255C%2522state%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522refinementFilters%255C%2522%253A%257B%255C%2522departments%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522165795011%255C%2522%255D%252C%255C%2522brands%255C%2522%253A%255B%255C%2522249943%257CLEGO%255C%2522%255D%257D%257D%252C%255C%2522version%255C%2522%253A1%257D%2522&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=e7f219edc6df22ec85ffa22440fa2e57&amp;language=en_US&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115142 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals-List-Noember-21-2026.jpg" alt="" width="788" height="848" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals-List-Noember-21-2026.jpg 788w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals-List-Noember-21-2026-279x300.jpg 279w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals-List-Noember-21-2026-768x826.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 788px) 100vw, 788px" /></a></p>
<p>Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<p>For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>For the Amazon LEGO 2026 Deals, check it out right here:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/4dYMzLn" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/40WwLo0">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3TkFHyh" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3V3vjwl">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/4jKQPPG" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3Ofv2CG">Amazon UK</a></p>
<p><strong>For Amazon LEGO Bestsellers List, check it out right here:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricksforum.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.toysnbricksforum.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="848" height="677" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 848px) 100vw, 848px" /></a></p>
<p>Disclosure Integrity &amp; Transparency: This post contains affiliate links. Toys N Bricks earns from qualifying purchases. Toys N Bricks is a participant of the <a href="https://amzn.to/2MZgozv" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon US</a>, <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/s?bbn=6303772011&amp;amp;rh=n%3A6205517011%2Cn%3A%216205518011%2Cn%3A6303772011%2Cp_89%3ALEGO&amp;amp;dc&amp;amp;fst=as%3Aoff&amp;amp;qid=1584647603&amp;amp;rnid=7590290011&amp;amp;ref=lp_6303772011_nr_p_89_1&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=5d48afd4da2b974b81ef49387a5138e8&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon Canada</a> and <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon United Kingdom</a> Associates program which provides advertising fees for sites. As an Amazon Associate, Toys N Bricks earns from qualifying purchases. Thank you for your support in the work that we do here.</p>
