		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=115125</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="656" height="918" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-Banner-Ad-Logo.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Insiders Weekend November 21-22, 2026 GWP Gift with Purchase Promotions - 40918 Winter Snow Globe and 40914 Retro Jukebox Banner Ad Logo" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-Banner-Ad-Logo.jpg 656w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-Banner-Ad-Logo-214x300.jpg 214w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 656px) 100vw, 656px" /></p>
<p>The Insider&#8217;s Weekend 2026 is now officially live at LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124; UK &#124; Australia). You will need a Insiders Rewards Membership</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-insiders-weekend-2026-gwp-points-promotions-sale-now-live-november-21-22-2026/">LEGO Insiders Weekend 2026 GWP, Points Promotions &#038; Sale Now Live: November 21-22, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114907 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-Banner-Ad-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="656" height="918" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-Banner-Ad-Logo.jpg 656w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotions-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-and-40914-Retro-Jukebox-Banner-Ad-Logo-214x300.jpg 214w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 656px) 100vw, 656px" /></p>
<p>The Insider&#8217;s Weekend 2026 is now officially live at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). You will need a Insiders Rewards Membership in order to qualify for the offers and promotions (free to join). Make sure to log in to your account in order to take advantage of the offers. Insiders Weekend run only from November 21-22, 2026 so its only two days for this epic event.</p>
<p>There are also Insiders Member Sale Pricing as well as 4x the amount of points on selected LEGO items (that&#8217;s 20% back in LEGO reward dollars). ALL LEGO purchases get double Insider Reward points as well (that&#8217;s basically 10% back in reward dollars). Check out our brief summary below.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Don&#8217;t miss out on any future LEGO News &amp; Deals by following us!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114962 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Center-Reward-Sets-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="709" height="781" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Center-Reward-Sets-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-Banner-Logo.jpg 981w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Center-Reward-Sets-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-Banner-Logo-272x300.jpg 272w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Center-Reward-Sets-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-Banner-Logo-929x1024.jpg 929w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Insiders-Center-Reward-Sets-for-Insiders-Weekend-November-21-22-2026-Banner-Logo-768x846.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 709px) 100vw, 709px" /></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">LEGO Insiders Weekend November 2026 Promotions Summary</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Starting November 20, 2026:</strong> New Insiders Rewards Available for Redemption &amp; FREE Sweepstake to potentially win 1 million Insiders Reward Points</li>
<li><strong>November 21-22, 2026: </strong>Double Insiders Reward Points on LEGO purchases</li>
<li><strong>November 21-22, 2026:</strong> Free LEGO 40918 Winter Snow Globe GWP gift set when you spend over $170 USD / $220 CAD / £155 GBP / $275 AUD</li>
<li><strong>November 21-22, 2026:</strong> Free LEGO 40914 Retro Jukebox GWP gift set when you spend over $250 USD / $325 CAD / £225 GBP / $410 AUD</li>
<li><strong>November 21-26, 2026:</strong> 4x Insiders Reward Points on selected LEGO items</li>
<li><strong>November 21-26, 2026:</strong> Insiders Member Sale Price &amp; Discount on selected sets</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114892 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box.webp" alt="" width="870" height="883" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box.webp 1182w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box-296x300.webp 296w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box-1009x1024.webp 1009w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box-768x780.webp 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Front-Box-1024x1040.webp 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 870px) 100vw, 870px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114894 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box.webp" alt="" width="930" height="942" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box.webp 1185w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box-296x300.webp 296w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box-1011x1024.webp 1011w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box-768x778.webp 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40918-Winter-Snow-Globe-GWP-Promo-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Back-Box-1024x1037.webp 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 930px) 100vw, 930px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114881 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box.webp" alt="" width="531" height="753" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box.webp 846w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box-212x300.webp 212w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box-722x1024.webp 722w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box-768x1089.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 531px) 100vw, 531px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114890 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Back-Box.webp" alt="" width="520" height="736" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Back-Box.webp 847w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Back-Box-212x300.webp 212w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Back-Box-723x1024.webp 723w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Back-Box-768x1088.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 520px) 100vw, 520px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113527 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Insiders-Double-Reward-Points-Promotion-Banner-Ad-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="783" height="459" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Insiders-Double-Reward-Points-Promotion-Banner-Ad-Logo.jpg 783w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Insiders-Double-Reward-Points-Promotion-Banner-Ad-Logo-300x176.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Insiders-Double-Reward-Points-Promotion-Banner-Ad-Logo-768x450.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 783px) 100vw, 783px" /></p>
<p><!--StartFragment --></p>
<p><!--EndFragment --></p>
<p>For the most up to date current LEGO promotions, offers and gift with purchase (GWP) being offered, check the official LEGO store promotional pages links below.</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>US United States</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Canada</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>UK United Kingdom</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Australia</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103542 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg" alt="" width="909" height="459" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg 909w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-300x151.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-768x388.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 909px) 100vw, 909px" /></p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are <span style="text-decoration: underline;">no ads</span> in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="690" height="551" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 690px) 100vw, 690px" /></p>
